WEBVTT

00:00:03.668 --> 00:00:07.008
Stonehenge is <b>older than</b> the Pyramids.

00:00:08.905 --> 00:00:11.895
Brazil is <b>wetter than</b> Ireland.

00:00:13.855 --> 00:00:17.229
New York is <b>more expensive than</b> Paris.

00:00:19.158 --> 00:00:22.296
My new job is <b>better than</b> my old one.

00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:27.527
The traffic is always <b>worse</b> in the evening.